        "pinyin": "Shùjù zài zhāshí, yě zhǐ fǎnyìng xiàncún cáiliào. Míng dài xìqǔ wénxiàn sànyì lǜ yuē liù chéng. Nǐ suǒ jiàn zhī qīshí fèn zīliào, shí jǐn bīngshān yī jiǎo. 'Bìrán' 'zhèngmíng' zhī duànyán, zài rúcǐ yàngběn xià, xuéjiè bù huì mǎi zhàng.",
        "english": "However solid the data, it reflects only extant material. Late-Ming dramatic documents have a loss rate of about 60%. The seventy items you've seen are only the tip of the iceberg. Assertions like 'inevitably' and 'prove' under such a sample will not be accepted by scholarship.",
