        "english": "Three-layer rule. Layer 1, reporting fact: add 'according to extant documents' / 'as currently visible' / 'as far as the author has seen'. Layer 2, explaining mechanism: add 'seems' / 'perhaps' / 'to some extent'. Layer 3, deriving conclusion: add 'awaits new materials' / 'this argument may not yet sustain general claim'.",
