        "english": "Your 'limitations' section is too short — just one paragraph. A good paper has 'study limitations' occupying 15-20% of methodology. You should explicitly note: (1) document loss rate, (2) regional bias of the samples you rely on, (3) absence of evidence from literati outside Jiangnan.",
