        "pinyin": "Sān bù: (1) shōují historical reception evidence — 19 shìjì mò shí wénrén bǐjì, pīpíng, xùbá, xiànjīn wǎngluò pínglùn, yǐngshì gǎibiān. (2) Reconstruct horizon of expectation (qídài shìyě) for each generation. (3) Bǐduì horizon zhī differences, guānlián textual features. Zhè shì standard Jausian protocol.",
