        "pinyin": "Nǐ gāngcái tídào 'narrative form biǎodá thought content'. Zhège formulation ràng wǒ xiǎngdào Roland Barthes «S/Z» de 5 codes. Nǐ zhī framework shìfǒu shòu Barthes yǐngxiǎng?",
